/**
 * The sections Premium adds to a generated site — MTC-FCS-015.
 * ============================================================================
 * One list, read by three places that must not disagree: the builder's option
 * boxes, the renderer that puts the sections on the page, and the checkout
 * summary that says what is being paid for.
 *
 * ── EVERY ONE OF THESE IS FILLED IN BY THE CONTRACTOR ──────────────────────
 * Nothing here is generated. A reviews section with invented quotes, or hours
 * guessed from a trade, is a claim the business never made — and reviews in
 * particular are the one thing on a contractor's site a customer is entitled
 * to assume is real. Turning a section on gives them an empty section to fill;
 * a section with nothing in it is simply not rendered.
 */

